OL,3,GNEWSAAI tools developed to tackle rise
OL,4,Ain AI use
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is building AI tools to help
OL,7,Fit process freedom of information (FOI)
OL,8,Frequests that are increasingly being
OL,9,Fwritten by AI.
OL,11,FDurham County Council's corporate data
OL,12,Fand insight manager Kim Teasdale said
OL,13,Fmore residents were using AI to send in
OL,14,FFOIs, which were longer and more
OL,15,Fcomplex than those constructed without
OL,16,Ftechnological assistance.
OL,18,FThis meant more time was required to
OL,19,Fdeal with each request, said Teasdale,
OL,20,Fso the council was exploring the use of
OL,21,FAI tools to streamline the process.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
