OL,3,GNEWSAAI tools developed to tackle rise
OL,4,Ain AI use
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe software could involve identifying
OL,7,Fand grouping together similar requests
OL,8,Fand pointing officials to relevant
OL,9,Fcouncil responses to previous FOIs, she
OL,10,Fsaid.
